  "description": "Plagued with splitting headaches, Ji-Min finds a doctor who diagnoses him with terrible news: he will die in three days unless he consumes someone else’s load. Ji-Min dismisses this as a quack doctor’s perverted scheme… until he wakes up to a mysterious screen counting down to his death. Seeing that the screen also states the same cure as the doctor did, Ji-Min decides to swallow the truth and the cure. Thus begins a series of steamy encounters that will save and change Ji-Min’s life entirely.\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Part of RIDI's Sengmotjung Danpyeonseon (섹못죽 단편선) Collection.*",
